{"seq":1,"slug":"origin-verification-recovery-tax","title":"原产地核查/退证/补税风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-verification-risk/origin-verification-recovery-tax","wordCount":1853,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"原产地核查-退证-补税风险\">原产地核查/退证/补税风险</h1><p>享惠的通关是「先信后查」：进口国海关先接受原产地声明，事后可以发起核查。核查到来时，企业要在有限时间内拿出一份能自证的证据包；拿不出，就会走到退证、补税与滞纳金这一步。这一篇讲核查的全流程与企业的自证准备。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>核查是把「先信后查」中的「查」落实的动作。它的形式是进口国海关向出口国主管机构发出核查请求，由后者向企业取证，再把结论回传。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[进口国海关怀疑] --&gt; B{核查形式}&#10;  B --&gt;|书面核查| C[要求提供单证与说明]&#10;  B --&gt;|实地核查| D[派员或委托访问企业]&#10;  B --&gt;|行政合作| E[请求出口国机构协助]&#10;  C --&gt; F[企业举证]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{结论}&#10;  G --&gt;|原产成立| H[维持享惠]&#10;  G --&gt;|存疑| I[补充材料]&#10;  G --&gt;|不成立| J[退证 补税 滞纳金]\">graph TD\n  A[进口国海关怀疑] --&gt; B{核查形式}\n  B --&gt;|书面核查| C[要求提供单证与说明]\n  B --&gt;|实地核查| D[派员或委托访问企业]\n  B --&gt;|行政合作| E[请求出口国机构协助]\n  C --&gt; F[企业举证]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{结论}\n  G --&gt;|原产成立| H[维持享惠]\n  G --&gt;|存疑| I[补充材料]\n  G --&gt;|不成立| J[退证 补税 滞纳金]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核查维度</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>企业准备</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发原因</td>\n<td>风险画像、随机抽查、情报线索</td>\n<td>复盘该批次的判定依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时限</td>\n<td>核查请求有法定答复期限</td>\n<td>预置证据包，避免临时拼凑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>举证范围</td>\n<td>证书、运输、供应商声明、成本数据</td>\n<td>按证据清单逐项归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结论效力</td>\n<td>可追溯既往、可对同类批次连带</td>\n<td>评估影响范围并批量处置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>救济</td>\n<td>复核、行政复议、司法救济</td>\n<td>保留完整记录以备申诉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核查的触发与形式\">核查的触发与形式</h2><h3 id=\"常见触发原因\">常见触发原因</h3><p>触发核查的因素包括：原产标准与货值明显不匹配、同一供应商的声明质量历史较差、某 HS 下该来源国享惠量突增、行业性反规避调查、以及纯随机抽查。工程上可以做的是监控自身数据中的异常信号，在核查之前自查。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种核查形式\">三种核查形式</h3><p>书面核查是最常见的，要求企业在期限内提交单证与书面说明。实地核查由进口国派员或委托第三方访问生产现场，验证生产工艺与 BOM。行政合作路径下，进口国通过出口国主管机构协助取证，企业面对的是本国机构而非直接面对进口国。三种形式的举证材料基本相同，差别在时限与深度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核查手段的成熟度\">核查手段的成熟度</h3><p>WCO 在优惠原产地核查上发布过控制与核查方法研究以及核查准则，用于提升成员海关的核查能力；同时对原产地违规做过类型学研究，并据此编写了应对指南，供海关在实务中识别与处置（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/origin/instrument-and-tools.aspx\">WCO Origin Instruments and Tools</a>）。这意味着核查不是随机翻账，而是有成型方法论的：企业自查时应假设对方会按同样的方法学来做交叉验证，例如把 BOM 成本结构与申报的原产标准做一致性比对。</p>\n<h3 id=\"答复时限与延期\">答复时限与延期</h3><p>核查请求通常有明确答复期限，逾期未答复往往直接被认定为不满足。企业应把证据包做成「可即时导出」状态，而不是核查通知到达后才开始翻档案。延期申请是否被接受取决于协定与对方机构裁量，不能作为默认策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退证与补税的计算\">退证与补税的计算</h2><h3 id=\"补税的三部分\">补税的三部分</h3><p>原产资格被否定后，进口方会补征：进口时少缴的关税差额、迟延利息或滞纳金、以及部分情形下的罚款。关税差额的计算基准是最惠国税率与原协定税率的差额，再乘以完税价格。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recovery</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>duty</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>MFN</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>FTA</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>Interest</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Penalty</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recovery} = V_{\\text{duty}} \\times (t_{\\text{MFN}} - t_{\\text{FTA}}) + \\text{Interest} + \\text{Penalty}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recovery</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">duty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MFN</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">FTA</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Interest</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Penalty</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"追溯范围\">追溯范围</h3><p>补税通常可以追溯若干年。追溯范围不只是被核查的那一批——如果核定结论是「判定方法系统性错误」，同类货物在同一期间内可能被批量追征。因此核查处置必须同步评估影响面，见第四章第三节的漏损分析方法论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"责任分配\">责任分配</h3><p>责任在进口商与出口商之间。进口商是向海关申报并享有优惠的一方，因此是补税的直接对象；进口商可以据合同向出口商追索。这意味着出口合同里的原产地条款（原产真实性担保与赔偿）在核查时具有直接经济价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"企业自证证据包\">企业自证证据包</h2><h3 id=\"证据包的组成\">证据包的组成</h3><p>一份能在核查中站住的证据包应包含：判定结论及其规则版本、BOM 展开快照、每层物料的原产证据（证书/长期声明/采购记录）、RVC 计算的数值明细与口径说明、运输与中转证明、以及证书本身的副本。缺项即弱点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;evidence_pack&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;certificate_ref&quot;: &quot;CO-2026-CN-004217&quot;,&#10;    &quot;verdict_snapshot&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;rule_version&quot;: &quot;RCEP-PSR-2026&quot;,&#10;      &quot;criterion_used&quot;: &quot;RVC40&quot;,&#10;      &quot;rvc_raw&quot;: 60.23,&#10;      &quot;accumulation_applied&quot;: [&quot;CN&quot;, &quot;JP&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;bom_snapshot_ref&quot;: &quot;BOM-BT-EARBUD-A1-v7@2026-08-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;material_evidence&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;material_id&quot;: &quot;PCB-FR4-4L&quot;,&#10;        &quot;origin&quot;: &quot;MY&quot;,&#10;        &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;LONG_TERM&quot;,&#10;        &quot;doc_ref&quot;: &quot;decl/SUP-88412_2026.pdf&quot;,&#10;        &quot;valid_to&quot;: &quot;2026-12-31&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      { &quot;material_id&quot;: &quot;SPK-40MM&quot;, &quot;origin&quot;: &quot;JP&quot;, &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;CERT&quot;, &quot;doc_ref&quot;: &quot;co/JP-2026-118822.pdf&quot; }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;transport_evidence&quot;: [&quot;BL-8842100&quot;],&#10;    &quot;cost_basis_note&quot;: &quot;RVC 依成交价格法，非原产材料按采购价计入&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_pack\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"certificate_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CO-2026-CN-004217\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"verdict_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RCEP-PSR-2026\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"criterion_used\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RVC40\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rvc_raw\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60.23</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"accumulation_applied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"bom_snapshot_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BOM-BT-EARBUD-A1-v7@2026-08-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"material_evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"material_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PCB-FR4-4L\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"origin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LONG_TERM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"doc_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"decl/SUP-88412_2026.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"valid_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-12-31\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"material_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SPK-40MM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"origin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CERT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"doc_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"co/JP-2026-118822.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"transport_evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BL-8842100\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cost_basis_note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RVC 依成交价格法，非原产材料按采购价计入\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"证据链的连续性\">证据链的连续性</h3><p>最容易被击穿的环节是<strong>中间层</strong>：成品层的证据齐全，但第一层物料（半成品）的供应商声明引用了第二层，而第二层的声明缺失或过期。核查时海关会要求逐层贯通，断在中间层的证据等于没有证据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"口径说明的重要性\">口径说明的重要性</h3><p>RVC 计算涉及大量口径选择（价值口径、汇率、调整项），同一份数据在不同口径下会得出不同结果。证据包里应附一份口径说明，把每个选择与其依据写清，避免被误认为计算错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风险防控与纠错\">风险防控与纠错</h2><h3 id=\"自查机制\">自查机制</h3><p>定期对高享惠额、高风险 HS、以及新供应商的判定做抽样复核，可以在核查前发现问题。复核应独立于日常判定流程，避免「自己查自己」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主动纠错\">主动纠错</h3><p>发现已签发证书存在错误时，主动作废或更正并在后续批次改用正确判据，通常比等待核查发现后果轻。主动纠错需要留存纠错记录，说明发现时间、原因与处置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不平衡的举证成本\">不平衡的举证成本</h3><p>核查的举证成本对企业是实打实的投入，而对海关是一次文书。因此防控重点应放在<strong>证据可得性</strong>上：让任何一份已签发的证书都能在几小时内导出带完整证据链的包，而不是在核查来了之后动员全公司找文件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其它章节的接口\">与其它章节的接口</h2><h3 id=\"输入来自前三章\">输入来自前三章</h3><p>核查的材料全部来自前面：判定标准（第一章）、判定数据与引擎结论（第二章）、证书与运输凭证（第三章）。核查暴露的问题会反向修正这三章的配置。</p>\n<h3 id=\"输出到度量\">输出到度量</h3><p>核查结论与补税金额是第四章第三节度量指标的重要输入——被追征的金额应当从「关税节省」中扣除，才能得到真实的净收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>核查是「先信后查」模式的落地，可由风险画像、情报或随机抽查触发。</li>\n<li>形式分书面核查、实地核查、行政合作三类，举证材料基本相同。</li>\n<li>补税 = 关税差额 + 利息/滞纳金 + 罚款，且可能批量追溯同类批次。</li>\n<li>证据包必须逐层贯通，中间层供应商声明缺失是最常见击穿点。</li>\n<li>RVC 计算应附口径说明，避免被误判为计算错误。</li>\n<li>主动纠错的后果通常轻于被核查发现，纠错记录本身也是证据。</li>\n<li>长期守住自主声明资格需要制度化内控，见 <a href=\"authorized-exporter-compliance\">经核准出口商合规与自主声明管控</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原产地核查/退证/补税风险","id":"原产地核查-退证-补税风险"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核查的触发与形式","id":"核查的触发与形式"},{"level":3,"text":"常见触发原因","id":"常见触发原因"},{"level":3,"text":"三种核查形式","id":"三种核查形式"},{"level":3,"text":"核查手段的成熟度","id":"核查手段的成熟度"},{"level":3,"text":"答复时限与延期","id":"答复时限与延期"},{"level":2,"text":"退证与补税的计算","id":"退证与补税的计算"},{"level":3,"text":"补税的三部分","id":"补税的三部分"},{"level":3,"text":"追溯范围","id":"追溯范围"},{"level":3,"text":"责任分配","id":"责任分配"},{"level":2,"text":"企业自证证据包","id":"企业自证证据包"},{"level":3,"text":"证据包的组成","id":"证据包的组成"},{"level":3,"text":"证据链的连续性","id":"证据链的连续性"},{"level":3,"text":"口径说明的重要性","id":"口径说明的重要性"},{"level":2,"text":"风险防控与纠错","id":"风险防控与纠错"},{"level":3,"text":"自查机制","id":"自查机制"},{"level":3,"text":"主动纠错","id":"主动纠错"},{"level":3,"text":"不平衡的举证成本","id":"不平衡的举证成本"},{"level":2,"text":"与其它章节的接口","id":"与其它章节的接口"},{"level":3,"text":"输入来自前三章","id":"输入来自前三章"},{"level":3,"text":"输出到度量","id":"输出到度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"证书签发流程与单证保存（联131）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/certificate-declaration/certificate-issue-record-retention"},"next":{"title":"经核准出口商合规与自主声明管控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-verification-risk/authorized-exporter-compliance"}}